From 8a1e557ff405488a60607c602b4b2f5c088bb349 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emma Anholt <anholt@igalia.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:07:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] ir3: Correct the IR3_REG_BNOT flags support.

It hasn't been used yet outside of nir_op_bitz, but I validated across the
opcodes on a530/a660/a750 in preparation for adding copy propagation
support for it.

Assisted-by: LLM
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45464>
(cherry picked from commit 1eb4fe36e7a12c574a1728190f26b86a7828fe98)
